title: "astro-ph-researcher: bilingual astronomy research workbench for Codex and DeepSeek Harness"
abstract: >-
  A local astronomy plugin for DSH and Codex: bilingual web UI, literature
  search and identifier checks, reading lists, writing projects, a beginner
  path, research plans, methods/statistics, observatory resources and
  evidence-aware handoff workflows. Scientific claims require author review.
